  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Only Memories Remain**: back after 27 archived shows (772 days) [4]\n- **Easy Morning Rebel**: back after 21 archived shows (580 days) [4]\n- **America**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **The First Time**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Purple Rain**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Mercy Mercy Me**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Like A Rolling Stone**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2017-12-30.mk41v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 149 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener describes the audio quality as incredible for an audience recording; MP3 metadata errors cause the tracks to play in the wrong sequence [2][3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2017-12-30.mk41v.flac16**: taped by Chris King; source: Schoeps mk41v (din) > kcy > aki > M222 > NT222 > Sonosax SX-R4+ (24/96) [1]",
